{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And I shall separate you from the peoples</b> — And adjacent to it: 'A man or a woman, when there shall be in them an ov or a yidde'oni' — for I have separated you from the nations and caused My Shekhinah to dwell among you, and you have no need for ov and yidde'oni like the other nations, who have no prophet nor knows what is to come, and therefore need ov and yidde'oni."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:09.956090320Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}